### 1. Check whether API is running
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### 2. Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### 3. Check loaded model
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/model-info

### 4. Test actual universal ML prediction (No Home_division needed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Gender": "Female",
    "Age": 22,
    "Family_background": "Lower Middle class",
    "Relationship_status": "Complicated",
    "Marital_status": "Unmarried",
    "Living_style": "Bachelor",
    "Current_semester": 7,
    "CGPA": 2.9,
    "friend_circle": "No",
    "Cost_without_study": 8000
}

### 5. Test negative class prediction
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Gender": "Male",
    "Age": 21,
    "Family_background": "Middle class",
    "Relationship_status": "In a Relationship",
    "Marital_status": "Unmarried",
    "Living_style": "Family",
    "Current_semester": 4,
    "CGPA": 3.75,
    "friend_circle": "Yes",
    "Cost_without_study": 3500
}
